<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/19th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Battle</p><h1 class="enc-title">Battle of Solferino</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1859">1859</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a> · Part of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/second-italian-war-of-independence">Second Italian War of Independence</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Battle of Solferino was fought on 24 June 1859 in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lombardy">Lombardy</a> between the French and Sardinian armies under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/napoleon-iii">Napoleon III</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/victor-emmanuel-ii">Victor Emmanuel II</a> and the Austrian army under Emperor <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/franz-joseph-i">Franz Joseph</a>. The Austrian defeat led to the loss of Lombardy and advanced <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italian-unification">Italian unification</a>. The suffering of the wounded moved <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/henry-dunant">Henry Dunant</a> to found the Red Cross.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-solferino.jpg" alt="Battle of Solferino" width="320" height="208" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Adolphe Yvon · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yvon_Bataille_de_Solferino_Compiegne.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
